# .graphifyignore
#
# Scopes the graphify knowledge graph to the codebase plus top-level project
# docs (README.md, CHANGELOG.md, etc.). Uses gitignore syntax and is merged
# after .gitignore, with these patterns winning on conflict (last-match-wins).

# GSD planning artifacts (the dominant node source)
.planning/

# throwaway working files
scratchpad/

# graphify's own output, must not index itself
graphify-out/

# agent config, not project code
.claude/
